Rāvaṇa gives Śūrpaṇakhā to Vidyujjihva --- Rāvaṇa meets Maya with daughter in forest --- Maya tells Hēmā loss and golden city --- Maya offers Mandōdarī and Rāvaṇa weds by fire --- Maya grants wondrous spear --- Rāvaṇa weds Kumbhakarṇa to Vairōcana granddaughter Vajrajvālā --- Vibhīṣaṇa weds Śailūṣa daughter Saramā of Mānasa lake --- Brothers sport with wives like Gandharvas --- Mandōdarī bears thunder-crying Mēghanāda who grows guarded
